# Session cookies for the seeded test accounts, cached so the suite does not re-log-in
# for every script and trip the 5-per-minute login limiter.
#
# These are live credentials. They must never be committed, which is the reason this file
# exists at all: the cache had been silently failing to write, so nothing had appeared in
# `git status` to prompt the question.
.sessions.json

# auth-fixes.mjs remembers the mixed-case account it registered, so a re-run does not need
# another registration against the 3-per-hour limiter. Also a credential.
.qa-*.json

# Sweep output. Findings from a run, not source.
sweep-findings.json
*shots/
